  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "将表示成$(a_n)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，我们用符号$(a_n)$表示上面所讨论的各项是分子等",
        "于1的真分数的数列，于是",
        "$a_1=\\frac{1}{2},a_2=\\frac{1}{3},a_3=\\frac{1}{4},a_{30}=\\frac{1}{31},a_{100}=\\frac{1}{101}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们指出，也可以用任何一个其他字母代替字母$a$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果数列是增函数，通常就把这种数列叫做增数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在第一个例子中，我们所讨论的以数字5结尾的两位数",
        "的数列，是较大的序号（较大的自变量值）对应于数列较大的",
        "项（较大的函数值）. 就是说，这个有限数列是增数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "偶数的无穷数列",
        "$2,4,6,8,\\cdots$",
        "也可以作为增数列的例子，其中每一项等于自身的序号的2",
        "倍."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "显然，每一项（从第2项起）都比它前面一项大的数列是",
        "增数列，而且只有这种数列才是增数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "类似地，如果数列是减函数，通常就把这种数列叫做减",
        "数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，有限数列$-2,-4,-6,-8,-10$是减数列，上面",
        "所讨论的分子等于1的真分数的无穷数列也是减数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "每一项（从第2项起）都比它前面一项小的数列是减数",
        "列，而且只有这种数列才是减数列."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "并非所有的数列都是增数列或减数列. 例如，有限数列",
        "$8,-6,4,-2,0$；",
        "无穷数列"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
